  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot \u015Fimdi sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "\u015Eimdi i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Be\u015Flisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 \"ters\"
    se\xE7tin.\n\nOlumsuz bir kart ters \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in ger\xE7ekten
    \xE7ok \u015Fansl\u0131s\u0131n. Bor\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131 \xF6demeye ba\u015Fl\u0131yorsun.
    S\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n karanl\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan ayd\u0131nl\u0131klara
    \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor, kasvetten, elem ve kederden kurtuluyorsun. \xC7evrenden
    en kritik zamanlarda yard\u0131mlar gelmeye ba\u015Flam\u0131\u015F {{isim}}.
    Zorluklar\u0131n ger\xE7ek anlamda sonuna yakla\u015Fm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Son
    y\u0131llarda ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n bir kay\u0131ptan kaynaklanan duygusal
    yaralar\u0131n var m\u0131yd\u0131? O yaralar bir \u015Fekilde kapanmaya ba\u015Fl\u0131yor.
    Gidenin ya da yitirilenin yeri elbette dolmaz fakat \xE7ok farkl\u0131 deneyimler
    ya\u015Fayabilece\u011Fin, sevgini ve dostlu\u011Funu payla\u015Fabilece\u011Fin
    bamba\u015Fka insanlarla kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Fmak \xFCzeresin."
